{"t":"TYL","made":"2026-11-27 02:42","name":"Tyler Technologies, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","employees":7972,"hq":"Plano, TX, United States","website":"https://www.tylertech.com","summary_en":"Tyler Technologies, Inc. provides integrated software and technology management solutions for the public sector in the United States. It operates in two segments, Enterprise Software and Platform Technologies. The company designs, develops, markets, and supports a range of software solutions to serve mission-critical back-office functions. It also offers platform and transformative technology solutions, such as cybersecurity services, including threat detection, response, vulnerability testing, and security training, data and insights, digital solutions, payments, platform technologies, and outdoor recreation solutions; public administration solutions, including civic services, ERP, property and recording, and regulatory; and corrections, courts and justice, and public safety solutions. In addition, the company provides school ERP and student transportation K-12 education solutions; and health and human services solutions comprising environmental health, and disability and benefits. It has a strategic collaboration agreement with Amazon Web Services for cloud hosting services. The company was formerly known as Tyler Corporation and changed its name to Tyler Technologies, Inc. in June 1999. Tyler Technologies, Inc. was founded in 1966 and is based in Plano, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Tyler Technologies, Inc.는 미국 공공 부문을 위한 통합 소프트웨어 및 기술 관리 솔루션을 제공합니다. 엔터프라이즈 소프트웨어와 플랫폼 기술이라는 두 가지 부문으로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 미션 크리티컬 백오피스 기능을 제공하는 다양한 소프트웨어 솔루션을 설계, 개발, 판매 및 지원합니다. 또한 위협 탐지, 대응, 취약성 테스트, 보안 교육, 데이터 및 통찰력, 디지털 솔루션, 결제, 플랫폼 기술 및 야외 레크리에이션 솔루션을 포함한 사이버 보안 서비스와 같은 플랫폼 및 혁신적인 기술 솔루션을 제공합니다. 시민 서비스, ERP, 재산 및 기록, 규제를 포함한 공공 행정 솔루션; 교정, 법원 및 사법, 공공 안전 솔루션. 또한 회사는 학교 ERP 및 학생 교통 K-12 교육 솔루션을 제공합니다. 환경 건강, 장애 및 혜택으로 구성된 보건 및 복지 서비스 솔루션이 포함됩니다. 클라우드 호스팅 서비스를 위해 Amazon Web Services와 전략적 협력 계약을 체결했습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Tyler Corporation으로 알려져 있었으며 1999년 6월에 Tyler Technologies, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. Tyler Technologies, Inc.는 1966년에 설립되었으며 텍사스 주 플레이노에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":420.28,"mcap":16710132736.0,"pe":52.46941,"fpe":27.021692,"peg":1.4471,"ps":6.7343073,"pb":6.0006566,"ev_ebitda":36.248,"div":0.0,"beta":0.732,"hi52":472.0,"lo52":270.71},"fin":{"rev":2481344000.0,"rev_g":0.087,"eps_g":0.207,"gross":0.47702998,"op":0.15735,"net":0.13512999,"roe":0.104890004,"fcf":689574976.0,"cash":879393984.0,"debt":1455303040.0,"de":52.155,"eps":8.01,"feps":15.55343},"own":{"short":0.0866,"inst":1.08542,"insider":0.0053399997},"analyst":{"n":22,"mean":450.0,"median":445.0,"high":525.0,"low":375.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.6087,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":6,"buy":13,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":6,"buy":13,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":6,"buy":13,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":6,"buy":13,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"Goldman Sachs","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":385.0,"priorPriceTarget":345.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":430.0,"priorPriceTarget":400.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"BTIG","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":430.0,"priorPriceTarget":400.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-27","Firm":"DA Davidson","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":460.0,"priorPriceTarget":460.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-27","Firm":"Needham","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","curre